A2%AB%E9%87%8D%E8%A7%86%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D%7D%5D\" data-ts=\"1632666172202\" data-col-type=\"l2r1\" contenteditable=\"false\" draggable=\"true\" data-empty-text=\"\"><div style=\"order: 0;\"> <div data-part=\"review\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--review obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器测评</h2> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/09/91006211/20bd282a85867dbd9c59428c9f1c3f08_8059637160856983318.gif\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">对小怪特攻的速射武器。被动对小怪（非Boss或精英怪）拥有高额全伤加成，杀敌后有较高概率在短时间内明显提高角色的物理伤害，适用于清小怪的场合。而深渊战场等主流玩法基本为Boss或精英怪且血量偏高，作用较低。激光类武器也由于输出方式尴尬的原因难以被重视</p></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc-gif\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/09/91006211/20bd282a85867dbd9c59428c9f1c3f08_8059637160856983318.gif\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__body-endpart\"><hr data-v-f0365338=\"\"> <p data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__copyright\"><img data-v-f0365338=\"\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        词条内容由圣芙蕾雅档案馆编辑团队原创，禁止转载\n      </p></div> <!---->",
